{"2817420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Attribute2", "steam_appid": 2817420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fun and casualthird-person shooting game. You can not only defeat opponents with weapons, but bullets can also <strong>modify the properties of almost any object in the scene, even the players themselves</strong>, helping you turn the tide in battle mode or find the exit in challenge mode! At the same time, in battle mode you can <strong>accumulate chances to draw cards, collect them to unlock various buffs and skills</strong>, and define your unique playstyle! The game features multiple maps, modes, items, characters, and weapons, offering a rich and diverse gameplay experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Refreshing Shooting:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a head-lock auto-aim system, you can shoot freely without precise aiming! Ensuring every player starts fairly and enjoys smooth gameplay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817420/extras/dc43b209d558b0af49fb067edf964ea7.poster.avif?t=1763383211\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817420/extras/dc43b209d558b0af49fb067edf964ea7.webm?t=1763383211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817420/extras/dc43b209d558b0af49fb067edf964ea7.mp4?t=1763383211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Attribute Adjustment:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify the attributes of any object on the map (including enemies and yourself), such as position, size, rotation, voltage, and more to create tactical advantages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817420/extras/44de79ddefa83a9b0b90fc68c268c269.poster.avif?t=1763383211\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817420/extras/44de79ddefa83a9b0b90fc68c268c269.webm?t=1763383211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817420/extras/44de79ddefa83a9b0b90fc68c268c269.mp4?t=1763383211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817420/extras/f2104da5fb6d41ce9c8bcf622735bcaa.poster.avif?t=1763383211\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817420/extras/f2104da5fb6d41ce9c8bcf622735bcaa.webm?t=1763383211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817420/extras/f2104da5fb6d41ce9c8bcf622735bcaa.mp4?t=1763383211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Scene Adjustment:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move, create, and duplicate objects and buildings in the scene to construct your own defensive fortress!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817420/extras/8ddd6c98ad148b6a67009bd45e30f4ff.poster.avif?t=1763383211\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817420/extras/8ddd6c98ad148b6a67009bd45e30f4ff.webm?t=1763383211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817420/extras/8ddd6c98ad148b6a67009bd45e30f4ff.mp4?t=1763383211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Card Upgrades:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain cards through battles to unlock buffs and skills, and build your unique playstyle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817420/extras/188bad64f79d7dcd47bb64eb543793c3.poster.avif?t=1763383211\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817420/extras/188bad64f79d7dcd47bb64eb543793c3.webm?t=1763383211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817420/extras/188bad64f79d7dcd47bb64eb543793c3.mp4?t=1763383211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Single-player Challenges:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don’t like PvP battles? The game also features brain-teasing challenge modes! Use attribute adjustments to solve puzzles and race against players worldwide!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817420/extras/233a7ceee243a503fe7637d648e88c1c.poster.avif?t=1763383211\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817420/extras/233a7ceee243a503fe7637d648e88c1c.webm?t=1763383211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817420/extras/233a7ceee243a503fe7637d648e88c1c.mp4?t=1763383211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fun and casualthird-person shooting game. You can not only defeat opponents with weapons, but bullets can also <strong>modify the properties of almost any object in the scene, even the players themselves</strong>, helping you turn the tide in battle mode or find the exit in challenge mode! At the same time, in battle mode you can <strong>accumulate chances to draw cards, collect them to unlock various buffs and skills</strong>, and define your unique playstyle! The game features multiple maps, modes, items, characters, and weapons, offering a rich and diverse gameplay experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Refreshing Shooting:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a head-lock auto-aim system, you can shoot freely without precise aiming! Ensuring every player starts fairly and enjoys smooth gameplay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817420/extras/dc43b209d558b0af49fb067edf964ea7.poster.avif?t=1763383211\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817420/extras/dc43b209d558b0af49fb067edf964ea7.webm?t=1763383211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817420/extras/dc43b209d558b0af49fb067edf964ea7.mp4?t=1763383211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Attribute Adjustment:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify the attributes of any object on the map (including enemies and yourself), such as position, size, rotation, voltage, and more to create tactical advantages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817420/extras/44de79ddefa83a9b0b90fc68c268c269.poster.avif?t=1763383211\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817420/extras/44de79ddefa83a9b0b90fc68c268c269.webm?t=1763383211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta